# Security

Never edit `.env`. Never commit secrets, API keys, or JWTs.

Do not `console.log` message bodies, tokens, or PII.

No SecureStore / AsyncStorage for session or tokens until the auth phase. No fake JWT.

No `fetch` to arbitrary or missing APIs. `avatarUrl` is mock-only (`null` → initials); do not load random remote images.

Phase 1 has no auth gate — that is intentional. Do not invent client-side “security” that hides routes without a real session.
